    "text": "The charge on the capacitor of capacitance \\(\\mathrm{C}\\) shown in the figure below will be\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/g4ETkv0XQ33PgdGmWcybZXMNRpiKj1UPJ9GvROhptnw.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
