  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(I=\\frac{E}{R_2+r}\\) (Since finally no current flows through capacitor)\n\\(\\therefore\\) Potential difference across \\(\\mathrm{R}_2, \\mathrm{~V}=\\mathrm{R}_2=\\frac{\\mathrm{ER}_2}{\\mathrm{R}_2+\\mathrm{r}}\\)\n\\(\\therefore\\) Charge on the capacitor \\(\\mathrm{Q}=\\mathrm{CV}=\\frac{\\mathrm{CER}_2}{\\mathrm{R}_2+\\mathrm{r}}\\)",
    "image": null
